    <h2>More frequently asked questions</h2>
    <h3>How soon can you start?</h3>
    <p>
        That depends on my current workload. Smaller tasks such as an upgrade analysis or debugging can usually be
        scheduled at short notice, larger projects we plan together. In the initial call I will give you a concrete
        start date.
    </p>
    <h3>Do you also work with existing teams?</h3>
    <p>
        Yes. I work on my own for smaller companies as well as reinforcing existing development teams or agencies
        that need additional Symfony experience for a project. I follow your processes, code reviews and tools.
    </p>

    <h2>Freelancer or agency?</h2>
    <p>
        With me, you talk to the person who writes the code. That saves coordination and project management
        overhead. For very large projects with many parallel roles an agency can still be the better fit. You will
        find an honest comparison in the guide <a href="{{ path('app_guide_agency') }}">Symfony freelancer or agency</a>.
    </p>

